aobscanregion(JourneyModeAob,Terraria.GameContent.Creative.CreativeUI::Draw,Terraria.GameContent.Creative.CreativeUI::Draw+E2,80 B8 ** ** ** ** 03)
alloc(JourneyModeCode,$1000,JourneyModeAob)
